    {
      "start": 0.9,
      "end": 4,
      "text": "Prepare for your licensing exams with Business Career College."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.6,
      "end": 11.5,
      "text": "Powered by ReadyEngine, our securities and insurance programs combine personalized preparation with a clear view of exam readiness."
    },
    {
      "start": 12.1,
      "end": 20.7,
      "text": "Your ReadyRating shows exam readiness on a scale of one to five, based on your demonstrated understanding of the concepts your exam requires."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.3,
      "end": 24.5,
      "text": "The breakdown shows which concepts need more practice."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.2,
      "end": 26.7,
      "text": "Here’s how it works."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.4,
      "end": 32.3,
      "text": "As you answer practice questions, ReadyEngine identifies where you need more support."
    },
    {
      "start": 33,
      "end": 40.7,
      "text": "It builds a plan around your needs and exam date, with lessons and practice to guide what you work on next."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.7,
      "end": 46.1,
      "text": "Practice exams are aligned to the concepts covered on your exam."
    },
    {
      "start": 47,
      "end": 52.4,
      "text": "You can ask questions and get explanations through Riley, your 24/7 study assistant."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.4,
      "end": 59.2,
      "text": "ReadyEngine keeps checking. It looks for understanding you can demonstrate more than once, without help."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.8,
      "end": 63.4,
      "text": "As you practise, your study plan and ReadyRating update."
    },
    {
      "start": 63.9,
      "end": 67.4,
      "text": "Concepts that need more attention return to your plan."
    },
    {
      "start": 68.4,
      "end": 76,
      "text": "With Business Career College, you can see where you stand and what to work on next, with focused preparation for your exams."
    },
    {
